# Cloudflare Pages headers.
#
# The equivalent block in vercel.json has NEVER reached production: this site
# is served by Cloudflare Pages (hcm-tables.com -> oracle-tables.pages.dev),
# so Vercel config is inert. Verified 2026-07-30 — the live site sent no
# Content-Security-Policy and no X-Frame-Options at all.
#
# Keep this in sync with vercel.json only if the site ever moves back; today
# THIS file is the one that takes effect.
#
# script-src / connect-src include outgoing-oyster-428.convex.site because the
# Harbor SEO snippet (harbor-seo.js) is embedded in every page and would be
# blocked without it.

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  X-XSS-Protection: 1; mode=block
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
